  "post_content": "<p>Cuarenta personas han participado este viernes por la noche en la primera cata de vinos organizada por el Ateneo Cultural y Mercantil de Onda, dentro de los actos de su 50&ordm; aniversario.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/01/IMG_5615.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La cata ha sido conducida por &Aacute;ngel Rodr&iacute;guez, delegado de ventas de Bodegas Lan, que ha presentado un blanco de la denominaci&oacute;n de origen Albari&ntilde;o y dos crianzas de 2009 de Rioja y Ribera del Duero.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tastvinsateneu/img_5611.jpg\" alt=\"img_5611\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tastvinsateneu/img_5612.jpg\" alt=\"img_5612\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tastvinsateneu/img_5613.jpg\" alt=\"img_5613\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tastvinsateneu/img_5614.jpg\" alt=\"img_5614\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tastvinsateneu/img_5616.jpg\" alt=\"img_5616\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tastvinsateneu/img_5617.jpg\" alt=\"img_5617\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tastvinsateneu/img_5618.jpg\" alt=\"img_5618\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tastvinsateneu/img_5619.jpg\" alt=\"img_5619\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tastvinsateneu/img_5621.jpg\" alt=\"img_5621\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tastvinsateneu/img_5622.jpg\" alt=\"img_5622\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tastvinsateneu/img_5623.jpg\" alt=\"img_5623\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tastvinsateneu/img_5624.jpg\" alt=\"img_5624\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
